{
  "id": "keystroke-align",
  "group": "keystroke",
  "title": "Keystroke 对齐层",
  "root": "~/.config/omarchy/plugins/evindor.keystroke",
  "note": "对齐补漏：①previewLabel/verb 既显示又作比较值的地方，比较值随译文同步（译了赋值不译比较会切断渲染分支/指示符）；②ui/ 目录（ConfirmSheet/PreviewPane/ResultRow）此前不在任何批次内的显示文案。CLIPBOARD/DICTATION/IMAGE 等徽标译成中文后，PreviewPane 的布局分支比较同步用中文。已核实：无其它地方再比较这些值（全局 grep）。",
  "replacements": [
    {
      "file": "ui/PreviewPane.qml",
      "find": "(row.previewLabel || \"\") === \"CLIPBOARD\" || (row.previewLabel || \"\") === \"DICTATION\"",
      "replace": "(row.previewLabel || \"\") === \"剪贴板\" || (row.previewLabel || \"\") === \"听写\"",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "providers/Clipboard.qml",
      "find": "previewLabel: \"CLIPBOARD\",",
      "replace": "previewLabel: \"剪贴板\",",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "ui/PreviewPane.qml",
      "find": "text: root.row.previewLabel || \"PREVIEW\"",
      "replace": "text: root.row.previewLabel || \"预览\"",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "ui/PreviewPane.qml",
      "find": "\"Press return to \" + String(root.row.verb).toLowerCase()",
      "replace": "\"按回车\" + String(root.row.verb)",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "ui/ResultRow.qml",
      "find": "root.verb === \"Open\" ? \"›\" : \"\"",
      "replace": "root.verb === \"打开\" ? \"›\" : \"\"",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "Keystroke.qml",
      "find": "? \"Open\" : \"Run\")",
      "replace": "? \"打开\" : \"运行\")",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "ui/ConfirmSheet.qml",
      "find": "property string cancelText: \"Cancel\"",
      "replace": "property string cancelText: \"取消\"",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "ui/ConfirmSheet.qml",
      "find": "property string confirmText: \"Confirm\"",
      "replace": "property string confirmText: \"确认\"",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "providers/Converter.qml",
      "find": "label: \"Your time zone\"",
      "replace": "label: \"你的时区\"",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "core/AiTargets.js",
      "find": "title: claude ? \"Ask Claude Code\" : \"Ask Codex\",",
      "replace": "title: claude ? \"向 Claude Code 提问\" : \"向 Codex 提问\",",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "core/AiTargets.js",
      "find": "subtitle: \"Terminal · new \" + cli + \" session with your prompt\", verb: \"Open terminal\",",
      "replace": "subtitle: \"终端 · 新建 \" + cli + \" 会话并带上你的提示词\", verb: \"打开终端\",",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "core/AiTargets.js",
      "find": "title: \"Ask Claude\",\n               subtitle: \"Claude desktop · new chat, prompt ready to send\", verb: \"Open Claude\",",
      "replace": "title: \"向 Claude 提问\",\n               subtitle: \"Claude 桌面 · 新对话，提示词已就绪\", verb: \"打开 Claude\",",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "file": "core/AiTargets.js",
